<body>
    <h1>DevOps Recommendation</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"401d5e56-30e9-43a8-a87a-232b38eafa1d">Reassess curre=
nt Solution Segmentation structure.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8eebb7d9-cf8b-4210-ae11-ecfeb0e33172">Concerns around scalab=
ility with current solution segmentation structure.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f49350b3-ba5e-48db-b4f8-9fd9a8e99baf"><strong>Current Soluti=
on Segmentation Model:</strong></p>
