<p local-id=3D"c9c589e1-fabf-456b-b968-c5311bd59b60">Sitemap</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"8ebb4555-5a0f-4c48-9e18-94f57ea5c4fc"></p>
<p local-id=3D"eb2287cd-34d0-4164-8b3a-fa5e39c7285f"><strong>Reassess Devop=
s Process for WRB:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"5b4aa6eb-7a9b-4fd9-9e40-4bfef965beca">In order to avoid deve=
lopment conflicts and overwriting committed un-released changes to main sol=
ution file(s). Recommend patch solutioning for keeping development work org=
anized and scalable. Solution patches only contain subcomponents of entitie=
s rather than the entire schema and all related assets. This keeps the solu=
tion lightweight and only includes the components that are created or updat=
ed. Example: create a new account field and update the existing account for=
m.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8e3efd77-31dc-4b22-b268-0e0ce1863e1b">More Information on Pa=
tching: <a class=3D"external-link" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"=
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/customerengagement/on-premise=
s/developer/create-patches-simplify-solution-updates?view=3Dop-9-1" local-i=
d=3D"896cc1eb-a68e-4c15-b1d6-38af18b94366" rel=3D"nofollow">https://learn.m=
icrosoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/customerengagement/on-premises/developer/cre=
ate-patches-simplify-solution-updates?view=3Dop-9-1</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"82fd4664-6d28-4ecc-ae15-acaac07b9465"><a class=3D"external-l=
ink" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"https://learn.microsoft.com/en=
-us/power-platform/alm/segmented-solutions-alm" local-id=3D"a01418e4-3cb4-4=
625-8133-dbe82cea2fe8" rel=3D"nofollow">https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/p=
ower-platform/alm/segmented-solutions-alm</a></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"1c1f4611-fb38-4ac7-a8dd-30f4abba227e">
<li local-id=3D"bb505965-a89b-49c0-93e1-9be171caf535">
<p local-id=3D"9afb6e39-06e4-4d99-b82d-c9f8f46fe28a"><strong>Dev1 </strong>=
</p>
</li>
</ol>
